The Crystal Globe is a casino in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]]. After the Party sold a stolen minivan to three members of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]], one of the buyers handed them a card for the Globe and told them to mention that Cosimo had sent them.
